<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: arial;"><br></span></div><div><div><div><font face="arial">We have received your request to switch your major.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">As you may be aware, some majors have admission standards beyond those for general admission to Arizona State University. Unfortunately, upon review of your admission credentials, you are not eligible for entry into this major at this point in time.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">You may view the admission standards for majors in Degree Search at <a href="https://asu.edu/degrees">asu.edu/degrees</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you would like to request changing to a different major, you may return to My ASU and submit a new request.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">If you have any questions, please contact me at&nbsp;</font><span style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</span><font face="arial">. I am your personal&nbsp;contact for admissions-related questions, and I’ll be happy to help you through the admissions process.</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Full_Name__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Title__c}</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Admission Services</font></div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Recruiter_Email__c}</font></div><div><font face="arial">{!Case.Opportunity_Owner_s_Pone__c}</font></div></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you have any additional information or questions related to this, please reply to this email.</font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
